  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fonio processing.Beneficiaries: 10 employees, part time laborers, ~ 500 suppliers.Description: The project will enable PROSAINS Benin to expand its production and marketing of processed fonio products through improved equipment, enhanced management and administrative systems, development of its supply chain to increase volume and traceability, and identification of new market opportunities.</narrative>
